      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#e8eae9;text-align:center;">We couldn't find your account</h1>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#c4c9d1;">Someone asked to verify this email address, but there is no Guilda Work account with it.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #2a2d33;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa1ab;">If this wasn't you, just ignore this email.</p>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
    <table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;">
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:18px 0 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center"><tr>
        <td style="background:#0c0e12;border:1px solid #2a2d33;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9aa1ab;">Guilda Work · management software for your firm</td>
      </tr></table></td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
